# Wireshark: The Basics

> TryHackMe Cybersecurity 101 — Networking

## Overview

This section documents my hands-on practice with Wireshark,
including packet capture, protocol identification, filtering,
and basic network traffic analysis.

The exercises are based on concepts learned from the
TryHackMe "Wireshark: The Basics" room and reproduced in my
own local lab environment.

---

## Learning Objectives

- Understand packet capture
- Identify network protocols
- Analyze TCP/IP traffic
- Analyze DNS traffic
- Understand ICMP traffic
- Use Wireshark display filters
- Inspect packet headers
- Follow network conversations
- Analyze basic network activity

